Package: TrajectoryDashboard
Title: Longitudinal Patient Trajectory Visualization from OMOP CDM Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Minqi", "Xiong", , "mxiong5@jhu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Interactive Shiny dashboard for longitudinal patient trajectory
    visualization based on OMOP CDM data. Integrates labs, medications,
    diagnoses, visits, and clinical notes into a three-layer trajectory view
    with phase abstraction (stable/worsening/flare/response/relapse), sparse-aware
    rendering, and decision-point detection to support clinical decision-making.
